Board-only suite: cast_device_registered names the device registry, and device trials run on the ESP32-S3 board only (as device_actor_addition). It carries no hosted .ascomp goldens, so the host integrate run skips this directory. Run it with make integrate TRIAL_TARGET=ESP32-S3_raw TRIAL_SUITES=cast_device_registered_unheld_name_board_addition from trials/.
